Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:26:52 +0600
Subject: [PATCH 12/14] frontend: fixes found in the browser smoke test

- Navbar and the student workspace tabs overflowed a 390px phone screen
  (horizontal scroll); both now fit.
- Student homework cards used see-through dark tints on the light page, which
  made their text unreadable; solid dark cards now.
- Tutors can open a student's uploaded homework file; 'nothing submitted' and
  'marked as submitted without a link' are told apart.
- Dashboard header counted students still waiting for a group as enrolled.
- Tutor-directory search on sign-up ignores replies for an older search.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011d4mgSxngjRmAXosGe4ry4
